refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
stringfalsedeflate_add DeflateContextcontext stringdata intflush_modeZLIB_SYNC_FLUSH
Incrementally deflates data in the specified context.

&reftitle.returnvalues;
Returns a chunk of compressed data, &return.falseforfailure;.
After a call with flush_mode set to ZLIB_FINISH completes the stream successfully, context is automatically reset and can be reused to compress a brand new, independent stream.

&reftitle.changelog;





    &Version;
    &Description;





    8.0.0

     context expects a DeflateContext
     instance now; previously, a resource was expected.
